    "name": "Is HH Remodeling LLC the Right Choice for Kitchen Upgrades?",
    "text": "Is HH Remodeling LLC the Right Choice for Kitchen Upgrades?",
    "@type": "Question",
    "answerCount": 1,
    "acceptedAnswer": {
      "text": "Is HH Remodeling LLC the right contractor to handle my kitchen upgrades?\n\nYes. HH Remodeling LLC is owned and operated by Abraham Becerra, a hands-on general and finish contractor with an A+ BBB rating serving Aurora and the greater Denver metro area. Rather than handing your home off to rotating salespeople or distant managers, Abraham acts as your direct contact and on-site lead throughout the project.\n\nWhat to Expect During the Process:\n- Direct communication: You work with an owner-operator who understands your vision and keeps communication open at every step.\n- Specialized finish work: HH Remodeling handles fine interior finish carpentry, custom drywall, and precision tile or marble installation in-house.\n- Reliable trade coordination: When upgrades involve mechanical systems, Abraham coordinates licensed plumbing and electrical sub-trades to ensure code compliance.\n- Honest scope assessment: You receive straightforward advice on whether existing cabinets can support new stone counters or if utility lines need updating first.\n\nWhether you are upgrading tile backsplashes, refreshing millwork, or modernizing kitchen fixtures, getting expert craftsmanship is essential. Contact Abraham Becerra at HH Remodeling LLC at 303-505-0866 or email Hhremodelingllc1986.ab@gmail.com for a detailed estimate.",
      "@type": "Answer",
      "author": {
        "name": "HH Remodeling LLC",
        "@type": "Organization"
      }
    }
  }
